; This project has long-standing peer-dependency conflicts (e.g. react-timestamp
; declares a react ^16 peer while the app is on react 17). npm 7+ (used by
; Netlify/CI) treats these as hard ERESOLVE errors and fails `npm ci`/`npm install`.
; legacy-peer-deps restores npm 6 behaviour (install anyway) so CI/deploy succeed.
legacy-peer-deps=true
